---
description: Backend test conventions
globs: backend/tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Test externally observable behavior rather than implementation details.
- Unit and domain tests must not depend on live infrastructure.
- Tests requiring MSSQL must use the existing `integration` marker.
- Normal test execution must remain usable without local MSSQL configuration.
- API contract tests should validate public HTTP and OpenAPI behavior.
- Changed behavior requires corresponding tests.
- Test fixtures must not contain real secrets or machine-specific credentials.
